  "_soloists_comment": [
    "Members who perform under their own name. Needed because a solo bill names",
    "the member, not the group, and the group's own prfcast is often empty so the",
    "roster cannot be derived from data alone.",
    "",
    "`aliases`    stage names — matched anywhere in a title or cast.",
    "`legalNames` the name KOPIS records — matched ONLY as a whole cast entry.",
    "",
    "The split matters: 이찬 (DINO) is a substring of trot singer 이찬원, and as a",
    "title alias it wrongly claimed 17 performances. A legal name is only ever",
    "compared against a complete comma-separated cast entry."
  ],
